      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WANT A WINNER (5) missed first-up over this track and trip when having every chance and feeling the pinch late. He should be better for that effort however and getting onto a firmer surface now is a big tick. Can get back to his best now with Pike sticking. THE CALABRESE (4) has been flashing from a long way back at this track and trip recently. He now draws a better barrier and he should settle closer in the run. Racing in top order and now gets every chance to return to winning ways. CAPPER THIRTYNINE (3) makes his WA debut today, coming across to the Aaron Mitchell yard. Back to 1200m on the fresh side won't be an issue and Parnham's booking is a good push for his chances. ICE PICK NICK (1) goes well fresh and was solid in a Listed race when first-up last campaign. Can feature.",
